1. EVERYONE: SHARE AND CHAT

You may, free of charge and without asking us:
  a. use the official PentaPets sticker packs published by @PentaPetsBot in Telegram
     and other chat apps;
  b. share unmodified screenshots, posts and videos that show the Art (for example
     fan posts, reviews, streams and news coverage), as long as you do not sell them
     as stand-alone products and you keep the credit "PentaPets (c) Mons Studio /
     EtherFantasy" where practical.


2. HOLDERS: YOUR NUMBERED STICKER

A "Holder" is the current owner of a numbered sticker edition (for example
"Barkindle #7/10") in the official PentaPets Sticker Store, or of the official
on-chain token for that edition if one is minted. For as long as you are the Holder,
we grant you a worldwide, non-exclusive, royalty-free license to:
  a. display your exact sticker anywhere: chats, profile pictures, social media,
     streams, websites and wallets;
  b. print your exact sticker, as is (resizing allowed), on physical items such as
     stickers, cards, apparel, mugs, cases and posters, for yourself or to give away;
  c. sell physical prints of your exact sticker, up to 500 items per edition per
     calendar year, provided each item keeps the edition number visible and carries
     the credit "PentaPets (c) Mons Studio / EtherFantasy". Larger runs need a
     written license from us.

These rights belong to the edition, not to you personally. When you sell, swap or gift
the edition, the rights pass to the new Holder and end for you. Items you lawfully
made while you were the Holder may still be kept, given away or resold.


3. NOT ALLOWED (FOR ANYONE, INCLUDING HOLDERS)

  a. Derivatives: changing, recolouring, remixing, tracing or redrawing the Art, or
     making new characters or variants from it, except resizing or cropping for
     display.
  b. Using any sticker or edition you do not currently hold for anything beyond
     section 1.
  c. Minting, tokenising or selling the Art as NFTs, tokens or digital collectibles
     anywhere other than the official PentaPets channels.
  d. Using the Art or names as a trademark, logo or brand, or in a way that suggests
     we endorse you or your product.
  e. Using the Art to train, fine-tune or prompt AI or machine-learning models, or
     in datasets.
  f. Use in hateful, defamatory, sexual, misleading or unlawful content, or in content
     aimed at deceiving children.
  g. Redistributing the sticker files as a pack, library, font, theme or asset
     collection.


